description: '''
PHIGHTHOUSE! is a style i made up which is basically  a combonation of phighting, a 5v5 fighting game by boggio, and whitehouse, a british extreme music band started by w. bennett.
this mod was originally made as "a mod within a mod" but it's has been decided to be it's own thing.
(note: this is mostly just an asset flip imo creds to the modders of vincenzotheduck, zac & Dagger.)
